sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: An await splits the check from the update
  accDescr: Both reserve calls check remaining equal to one and suspend at the shared gate. The gate is released once. A resumes and decrements remaining to zero, returning true. B then resumes and decrements it to minus one, returning true. This is one possible continuation order and violates capacity safety.
  participant A as Call A
  participant B as Call B
  Note over A,B: Shared remaining=1
  A->>A: Check passes, await gate
  B->>B: Check passes, await gate
  Note over A,B: Gate released once<br/>Both may resume
  A->>A: remaining-- gives 0<br/>Return true
  B->>B: remaining-- gives -1<br/>Return true
  Note over A,B: Two successes for one unit<br/>Safety violated


